    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i see. so it's a bit of a debate over whether the history is actually settled or not. given how much people disagree on what the founders actually meant, is originalism still considered a legitimate scholarly framework in most law schools, or is it seen more as a fringe or partisan approach these days?",
